==History==
2016
*The Giant Skeleton [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 2/2/2016, the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]], added the Death Damage statistic on the Giant Skeleton's card info screen.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], increased the Giant Skeleton's hitpoints by 11% and death damage time to 3 seconds (from 1 second). It also decreased the Giant Skeleton's sight range to 5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May%202016%20Update%20(3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], fixed the "range bug" and decreased the Giant Skeleton's range to 0.8 tiles (from 2 tiles), but his effective range was unchanged. There was also an unannounced change to the Giant Skeleton, a decrease to his collision radius to 1 tile (from 1.2 tiles).
*On 4/7/2016, the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]], increased the Giant Skeleton's damage by 20%.
*On 1/11/2016, the [[Version History#November 2016 Update (1/11/2016)|November 2016 Update]], changed the Giant Skeleton's sound effects, and he now laughs when deployed.
*On 15/12/2016, the [[Version History#December 2016 Update (15/12/2016)|December 2016 Update]], increased the Giant Skeleton's damage by 8%.
2017
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]], increased the Giant Skeleton‘s hitpoints by 5%.
2018
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
2019
*On 1/4/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/4/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Giant Skeleton’s first attack time interval to 0.3 seconds (from 0.5 seconds) and increased his mass to 18 (from 15).
*On 5/8/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/8/2019)|Balance Update]], removed the Giant Skeleton from all [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Draft]] selections.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Giant Skeleton's card info screen.
2021
*On 30/3/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%201%20Update%20(30/3/2021)|2021 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Giant Skeleton's death damage by 54% and increased his damage by 29%.
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], gave the Giant Skeleton's bomb the ability to inflict double damage on [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Towers]]. It also moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Giant Skeleton from Bone Pit to P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 4/4/2022, the [[Version History#April%202022%20Update%20(4/4/2022)|April 2022 Update]], increased the Giant Skeleton’s hitpoints by 7% and decreased his attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1.5 seconds).
*On 3/6/2022, a maintenance break, changed the Giant Skeleton card image and card render.
*On 12/9/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (12/9/2022)|maintenance break]], decreased the Giant Skeleton's hitpoints by 5%.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Giant Skeleton from P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse to Frozen Peak.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 3/1/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/1/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Giant Skeleton's hitpoints by 6%.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Giant Skeleton's hitpoints by 0.02%, decreased his damage by 0.37%, and increased his death damage by 0.18%.
*On 8/7/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/7/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Giant Skeleton's damage by 4%.
*On 24/11/2025, the [[Version History#Level 16 Update (24/11/2025)|Level 16 Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 16 (from 15).
2026

* On 12/1/2026, a [[Version History#January 2026|Balance Update]], decreased the Giant Skeleton's attack time interval to 1.3 seconds (from 1.4 seconds).
* On 4/5/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Giant Skeleton's death damage by 29%, decreased his hitpoints by 7%, decreased his collision radius to 0.75 tiles (from 1 tile), reduced his model size and removed his bomb's ability to inflict double damage on [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Towers]].

